#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-data-map.md:1
#: 066a4bec99d845cdb0ca8b73282b8cc5
msgid "数据地图：组分、结构相与磁类型"
msgstr "Data map: composition, phases, and magnetic types"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1190
#: 33706fbfe3c545aca3334714df5627fc
msgid ""
"「组分地图」按精确原子比例合并结构。例如，`Fe2Ni2`、`Fe4Ni4` 和 `Fe32Ni32` 都"
"归入同一个 `Fe:Ni = 1:1` 组分点。右侧表格仍保留结构数量、原子数和 "
"`Config_type`，不会把不同尺寸的结构当成同一个结构。"
msgstr "The Composition Map merges structures by exact atomic ratio. For example, `Fe2Ni2`, `Fe4Ni4`, and `Fe32Ni32` belong to the same `Fe:Ni = 1:1` composition point. The table on the right still keeps the structure count, atom count, and `Config_type`, so different sizes are not treated as the same structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1192
#: 89f2a966f1784196bff2a907119f01b4
msgid ""
"第一次进入时，柱高表示该浓度下的结构数。基础诊断显示后，页面默认自动在后台遍"
"历当前评估范围内的所有结构；不需要另找按钮启动。大体系如果不希望自动分析，可"
"在「设置 → 个性化」中关闭「自动分析结构证据」。分析完成后会增加两种视图，但不"
"会擅自切换当前组分图："
msgstr ""
"On first entry, bar height shows the number of structures at each composition. "
"After the basic diagnostics appear, the page automatically scans every structure "
"in the current audit scope in the background; there is no separate start button. "
"For large systems, disable `Analyze structure evidence automatically` under "
"`Settings → Personalization` if automatic analysis is undesirable. Completion "
"adds two more views without switching away from the current composition map:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1194
#: 244a8879fad64816a85f06c80947cda3
msgid ""
"**结构相：** FCC、HCP、BCC，以及通过保守模板确认的 A4、L1₀、L1₂、B1、B2、B3、"
"B4、C1、B8₁、D0₃、L2₁、C1ᵦ、D0₁₉、C14、C15；其余显示为混合局域结构或未解析；"
msgstr ""
"**Structural phase:** FCC, HCP, BCC, plus A4, L1₀, L1₂, B1, B2, B3, B4, C1, "
"B8₁, D0₃, L2₁, C1ᵦ, D0₁₉, C14, and C15 when confirmed by conservative "
"templates; all other cases are shown as mixed local structure or unresolved;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1195
#: f87e0ae8da6f42fa99d3fba25436efa0
msgid ""
"**磁类型：** FM、AFM（未细分）、逐层 AFM（`↑↓`）、双层 AFM（`↑↑↓↓`）、FiM、"
"PM-like（自旋无序）、其他非共线、未识别、低／零磁矩和无有效 `spin` 字段。"
msgstr ""
"**Magnetic type:** FM, AFM (not further classified), layer-by-layer AFM "
"(`↑↓`), double-layer AFM (`↑↑↓↓`), FiM, PM-like (spin-disordered), other "
"noncollinear, unrecognized, low/zero moment, and no valid `spin` field."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1197
#: 0f76f44aef1545eca02cf2ad8e84c20a
msgid ""
"分析结束后，可以先选组分，再用结构相和磁类型下拉框继续筛选。点击「查看选中的"
"结构」即可回到 `NEP Dataset Display`。"
msgstr ""
"After analysis, select a composition first, then refine the selection with the "
"structural-phase and magnetic-type lists. Click `View selected structures` to "
"return to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1199
#: dc06f796ae954174b7addd76989eff2b
msgid ""
"相和磁是两条独立证据。同一个 FCC 或 BCC 骨架可以承载不同磁结构，所以页面不会"
"把它们合成一个不可拆分的标签。`Config_type` 只是来源元数据，不参与结构相或磁"
"类型判断。"
msgstr ""
"Phase and magnetism are independent evidence channels. The same FCC or BCC "
"framework can support different magnetic structures, so the page does not merge "
"them into one inseparable label. `Config_type` is source metadata only and does "
"not participate in structural-phase or magnetic-type identification."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1201
#: f52d6ec07c3b4d1ca6115230428b08c5
msgid ""
"在「进阶证据 → 磁序」中还可以切换三张按结构帧数归一化的 100% 堆叠图：每个结构"
"相中的磁类型占比、每个磁类型中的结构相占比，以及整个评估范围的磁类型占比。颜"
"色段中的百分比和右侧帧数分别回答“占多少”和“有多少帧”；点击任一颜色段可回选对"
"应结构。"
msgstr ""
"Under `Advanced Evidence → Magnetic Order`, three 100% stacked charts normalized "
"by structure-frame count are available: magnetic-type shares within each "
"structural phase, structural-phase shares within each magnetic type, and magnetic-"
"type shares across the full audit scope. Percentages inside colored segments show "
"the share, while frame counts on the right show the absolute number of frames. "
"Click any segment to select its structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1203
#: 6c15522228cb4f629c70c0fdd9b00b89
msgid ""
"训练集评估的磁类型占比视图，显示图表切换、结构帧占比、颜色图例和结构回选入口"
msgstr "Training Set Audit magnetic-type share view, showing chart switching, structure-frame shares, the color legend, and structure-selection entry point"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1203
