#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1208
#: e46f762d761e41778c19f3d6b23f9559
msgid ""
"训练集评估的组分地图，标出证据层切换、相分布柱图、精确组分表和结构回选控件"
msgstr "Training Set Audit composition map, highlighting evidence-layer switching, the phase-distribution bars, exact-composition table, and structure-selection controls"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1208
