#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1213
#: b303699846fa4f89ac8bb748a5e8fe18
msgid ""
"上图使用的示例数据只有一个 `Pb:Te = 1:1` 精确组分点，而且 a-CNA 和内置原型模"
"板都没有给出强证据，因此柱子显示为灰色「未解析」。这不是程序出错，而是「当前"
"几何证据不足以给出已支持标签」。如果数据带有有效 `spin:R:3`，右上角证据层还会"
"出现「按磁序着色」，下方磁序筛选框也会启用。"
msgstr ""
"The example above has only one exact composition point, `Pb:Te = 1:1`, and "
"neither a-CNA nor the built-in prototype templates provide strong evidence. The "
"bar is therefore gray and labeled `Unresolved`. This is not an application error; "
"it means the current geometric evidence is insufficient for a supported label. If "
"the data contain a valid `spin:R:3` field, `Color by magnetic order` also appears "
"in the evidence-layer selector and the magnetic-order filter below is enabled."
